RFC 8785 (JCS) conformance vectors
==================================

The files under input/ and output/ in this directory are copied verbatim from:

    https://github.com/cyberphone/json-canonicalization
    path: testdata/input/, testdata/output/
    retrieved: 2026-09-04 (master branch)

    Copyright 2018 Anders Rundgren
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

They are used as DATA ONLY, to test this repository's own RFC 8785
implementation against an independently produced oracle.

No source code from that project was copied, adapted, or derived.
packages/core/src/hashing.ts was written from RFC 8785 itself.

The files are unmodified. .gitattributes marks this directory `-text` so the
bytes -- including line endings, which matter for a canonicalization fixture --
survive checkout on every platform.
